WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.110
 Hi, Marvel fans.

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:02.550
I'm here with Arian Moayed.

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.430
How's it going?

00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:04.230
How are you feeling?

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:07.360
 I am feeling
overwhelmed, excited.

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.360
I cannot wait to see
it on a big screen.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.610
I'm, like, over the moon
about this whole thing.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.770
 How does it feel to
be a part of the MCU?

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:14.677
 It's surreal.

00:00:14.677 --> 00:00:15.510
I'm not gonna lie to you.

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:18.300
It's completely surreal
to be a part of Marvel.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.920
You know, I was born in Iran.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:22.770
And so to have that
be from there to here

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:24.880
is a real surreal moment for me.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:26.400
So I really, really--

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.220
you know, I'm just honored
and blessed, really.

00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:30.630
 Oh, that's so good to hear.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.220
Well, I'm excited for you.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:35.460
What are you looking forward
to most in the film tonight?

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:37.800
 I am looking forward to--

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:43.086
selfishly, I'm looking forward
to my interrogation with Ned.

00:00:43.086 --> 00:00:44.940
[LAUGHS] Spoiler.

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:46.260
INTERVIEWER: OK, OK.

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:49.140
 But most of what I'm
really looking forward to

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:52.170
is watching Tom
Holland and watching

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:55.270
all these folks make
these amazing human beings

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:56.070
come to life.

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:57.780
I mean, that's what
I'm looking forward to.

00:00:57.780 --> 00:00:59.040
 I mean, this is big.

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:00.990
This film, everyone
knows who Peter

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:03.060
Parker's secret identity is.

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:03.870
It's Spider-Man.

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:05.790
How does your character
feel about that?

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:08.730
 Obviously, he-- he's
interrogating him.

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:11.280
So he comes in and really
interrogates the group

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:14.160
and really kind of tells
them, listen, you shouldn't

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:16.080
have done that, you know.

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:18.680
Anyway, I'm really just
excited to be here and be

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:20.130
a small part of this movie.

00:01:20.130 --> 00:01:23.480
[MUSIC PLAYING]

